{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003294","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003294"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003294","label":"陳豨（蕭相國世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"陳豨","mention_ids":["c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0005","c-shiji-053-xiao:m011-0048","c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0259"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0005","chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p010","quote":"陳豨"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m011-0048","chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p011","quote":"陳豨"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0259","chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p012","quote":"陳豨"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"陳豨","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003294","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p010","chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m011-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"陳豨","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003294","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0259","start":259,"end":261,"surface":"陳豨","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003294","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji053-009","person_id":"cbr-p003294","surfaces":["陳豨"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-053-xiao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p010","quote":"漢十一年，陳豨反，高祖自將，至邯鄲。未罷，淮陰侯謀反關中，呂后用蕭何計，誅淮陰侯，語在淮陰事中。上已聞淮陰侯誅，使使拜丞相何為相國，益封五千戶，令卒五百人一都尉為相國衛。諸君皆賀，召平獨吊。召平者，故秦東陵侯。秦破，為布衣，貧，種瓜於長安城東，瓜美，故世俗謂之「東陵瓜」，從召平以為名也。召平謂相國曰：「禍自此始矣。上暴露於外而君守於中，非被矢石之事而益君封置衛者，以今者淮陰侯新反於中，疑君心矣。夫置衛衛君，非以寵君也。原君讓封勿受，悉以家私財佐軍，則上心說。」相國從其計，高帝乃大喜。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p011","quote":"漢十二年秋，黥布反，上自將擊之，數使使問相國何為。相國為上在軍，乃拊循勉力百姓，悉以所有佐軍，如陳豨時。客有說相國曰：「君滅族不久矣。夫君位為相國，功第一，可複加哉？然君初入關中，得百姓心，十餘年矣，皆附君，常複孳孳得民和。上所為數問君者，畏君傾動關中。今君胡不多買田地，賤貰貸以自汙？上心乃安。」於是相國從其計，上乃大說。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p012","quote":"上罷布軍歸，民道遮行上書，言相國賤彊買民田宅數千萬。上至，相國謁。上笑曰：「夫相國乃利民！」民所上書皆以與相國，曰：「君自謝民。」相國因為民請曰：「長安地狹，上林中多空地，棄，原令民得入田，毋收槁為禽獸食。」上大怒曰：「相國多受賈人財物，乃為請吾苑！」乃下相國廷尉，械繫之。數日，王衛尉侍，前問曰：「相國何大罪，陛下系之暴也？」上曰：「吾聞李斯相秦皇帝，有善歸主，有惡自與。今相國多受賈豎金而為民請吾苑，以自媚於民，故系治之。」王衛尉曰：「夫職事苟有便於民而請之，真宰相事，陛下奈何乃疑相國受賈人錢乎！且陛下距楚數歲，陳豨、黥布反，陛下自將而往，當是時，相國守關中，搖足則關以西非陛下有也。相國不以此時為利，今乃利賈人之金乎？且秦以不聞其過亡天下，李斯之分過，又何足法哉。陛下何疑宰相之淺也。」高帝不懌。是日，使使持節赦出相國。相國年老，素恭謹，入，徒跣謝。高帝曰：「相國休矣！相國為民請苑，吾不許，我不過為桀紂主，而相國為賢相。吾故系相國，欲令百姓聞吾過也。」"}],"rationale":"依明示名與局部丞相、相國及軍事敘事暫接，何字先排疑問詞；秦東陵侯召平不接齊相，未名署稱不補姓名，桀紂為比擬人物不冒稱當時在場。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:p010","text":"漢十一年，陳豨反，高祖自將，至邯鄲。未罷，淮陰侯謀反關中，呂后用蕭何計，誅淮陰侯，語在淮陰事中。上已聞淮陰侯誅，使使拜丞相何為相國，益封五千戶，令卒五百人一都尉為相國衛。諸君皆賀，召平獨吊。召平者，故秦東陵侯。秦破，為布衣，貧，種瓜於長安城東，瓜美，故世俗謂之「東陵瓜」，從召平以為名也。召平謂相國曰：「禍自此始矣。上暴露於外而君守於中，非被矢石之事而益君封置衛者，以今者淮陰侯新反於中，疑君心矣。夫置衛衛君，非以寵君也。原君讓封勿受，悉以家私財佐軍，則上心說。」相國從其計，高帝乃大喜。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"陳豨","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003294","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003287","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"淮陰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003290","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"呂后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003295","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"蕭何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"淮陰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003290","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"淮陰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003290","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"淮陰侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003290","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"丞相","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"相國","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0073","start":73,"end":77,"surface":"卒五百人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"都尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"相國","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"諸君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"召平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003296","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m010-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"召平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003296","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sh