衛尉曰：「夫職事苟有便於民而請之，真宰相事，陛下奈何乃疑相國受賈人錢乎！且陛下距楚數歲，陳豨、黥布反，陛下自將而往，當是時，相國守關中，搖足則關以西非陛下有也。相國不以此時為利，今乃利賈人之金乎？且秦以不聞其過亡天下，李斯之分過，又何足法哉。陛下何疑宰相之淺也。」高帝不懌。是日，使使持節赦出相國。相國年老，素恭謹，入，徒跣謝。高帝曰：「相國休矣！相國為民請苑，吾不許，我不過為桀紂主，而相國為賢相。吾故系相國，欲令百姓聞吾過也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"布","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003297","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"民","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"相國","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"民","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"相國","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"相國","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003286","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"民","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、官署或未定回指；不補姓名或後嗣成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-053-xiao:m012-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"民","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolve